pmc:ChaosMagicVmAKnowingSigilWellEnoughDrawIt a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Knowing the sigil well enough to draw it from memory"@en, "Die Sigille auswendig zeichnen können"@de ;
    skos:definition "Familiarity with the sigil's shape, defined as being able to reproduce it from memory; the author counts this enough for physical work, while sustained clear imagining is needed only for astral or closed-eye work."@en ;
    skos:note "Added by the integrator from the reading of the whole text; no extraction record carries it."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 2 The Ritual, p. 20; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmALongClearVisualizationUnnecessary a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Long clear visualization unnecessary"@en, "Dauerhafte Visualisierung unnötig"@de ;
    skos:definition "Against some unnamed authors who demand that the sigil be held clearly in imagination for long, the author finds familiarity sufficient since the sigil has a physical form; sustained clear imagery is needed only for astral or closed-eye work, where simple sigils suffice."@en ;
    skos:note "Disagreement with unnamed authors, therefore recorded as concept."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 2 The Ritual, p. 20; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmAMakingManySigilsYieldsDiscernmentYield a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Making many sigils yields discernment"@en, "Viele Sigillen ergeben Unterscheidung"@de ;
    skos:definition "Creating dozens of sigils produces the ability to assign them to physical or astral work."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChaosMagicVmASparesLetterReductionSigil ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:ChaosMagicVmAKnowingWhichSigilsSuitPhysicalAstral ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
