pmc:ChaosMagicVmAKnowingWhichSigilsSuitPhysicalAstral a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Knowing which sigils suit physical or astral work"@en, "Unterscheidung physisch/astral"@de ;
    skos:definition "After making a few scores of sigils the practitioner can tell which suit physical and which astral use."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 2 The Ritual, p. 20; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmAVacuitySuspensionConsciousIdentity a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Vacuity: suspension of conscious identity"@en, "Leere: Aufhebung der Identität"@de ;
    skos:definition "A state in which the armour of habit and self-assurance develops gaps through which the deep mind can be reached, allowing ego-free transmission; Spare stressed vacuity and exhaustion."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 2 The Ritual, p. 21; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmp:ChaosMagicVmAPhysicalExhaustion a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Physical exhaustion"@en, "Körperliche Erschöpfung"@de ;
    skos:definition "Use long wilderness walks, dancing, chanting, sex or martial arts until you forget your civilized persona, sweat heavily and become body-conscious."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 2 The Ritual, p. 21; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmAExhaustionYieldsVacuityYield a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Exhaustion yields vacuity"@en, "Erschöpfung ergibt Leere"@de ;
    skos:definition "Physical exhaustion suspends conscious identity."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChaosMagicVmAPhysicalExhaustion ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:ChaosMagicVmAVacuitySuspensionConsciousIdentity ;
