pmc:ChaosMagicVmACrisisDissolvesIdentity a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Crisis dissolves identity"@en, "Krise löst Identität"@de ;
    skos:definition "Disappointment, pain, doubt, sickliness and illness make holes in personality, remove necessity and dissolve stagnant belief; crisis is a chance to discard the useless and see afresh."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 2 The Ritual, p. 21; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmADoSeekCrisisDeliberatelyCaution a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Do not seek crisis deliberately"@en, "Krise nicht herbeiführen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Crisis need not be provoked; more crisis does not mean more inspiration and one need not tear oneself apart; crisis should not be sought and not be avoided, honesty is what is required."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmc:ChaosMagicVmACrisisDissolvesIdentity ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 2 The Ritual, p. 21; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmAEffortNeededDependsEgoStrength a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Effort needed depends on ego strength"@en, "Aufwand hängt vom Ego ab"@de ;
    skos:definition "A strong ego needs far greater effort (fasting, oaths, abstinence, elaborate rites) to reach vacuity than one who avoids self-importance; greater effort does not mean greater results; those claiming exalted authority usually cannot laugh at themselves and need drastic measures."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 2 The Ritual, p. 21; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmp:ChaosMagicVmASuspendingEgoThroughJoy a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Suspending ego through joy"@en, "Ego-Aufhebung durch Freude"@de ;
    skos:definition "Use intense pleasure, love and exhilaration to empty the mind."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 2 The Ritual, p. 22; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmAJoyYieldsVacuityYield a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Joy yields vacuity"@en, "Freude ergibt Leere"@de ;
    skos:definition "Intense joy opens the gates to the deep."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChaosMagicVmASuspendingEgoThroughJoy ;
