pmc:ChaosMagicVmADrugsDisturbTransmissionCaution a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Drugs disturb transmission"@en, "Drogen stören"@de ;
    skos:definition "Drugs may open the mind but, unless one is well used to them and the dose is exactly right, they impair concentration and distort transmission."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmc:ChaosMagicVmAVacuitySuspensionConsciousIdentity ;
