pmc:ChaosMagicVmADoEvaluateOutputEgoWillDisparageCaution a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Do not evaluate output; ego will disparage"@en, "Nicht bewerten"@de ;
    skos:definition "Learning spontaneous drawing opens a gate for the deep, which ego fears; it will claim the efforts are useless, the results poor and one’s talents elsewhere, and compare the work with real artists who had the same troubles; problems should not bring one down."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmp:ChaosMagicVmACirclesSpiralsExercise ;
