    rdfs:label "Condensed spontaneous outbursts"@en, "Verdichtete Ausbrüche"@de ;
    skos:definition "Condense the flowing line into short, swift bursts of spontaneous motion, forming meaningful shapes on the spot and stopping before the structure grows too complex; later fill pages with them as single units or one interwoven line."@en ;
