    rdfs:label "Mind imposes known forms on chaos; vacuity helps"@en, "Ordnung im Chaos"@de ;
    skos:definition "Spontaneous structures suggest meaningful shapes because the mind reads the unknown through the known and orders chaos for safety, as when seeing a carving in a gnarled root; an empty mind helps images arise."@en ;
