    rdfs:label "Edit only after the picture has come through"@en, "Erst durchkommen lassen, dann bearbeiten"@de ;
    skos:definition "Spontaneous drawings are rarely perfect and contain waste lines or gaps; removing and emphasizing lines is allowed only once the basic structure is through; while it is emerging one must not judge, control or interfere, only watch the hand, whose motion runs slightly ahead of comprehension."@en ;
