pmc:ChaosMagicVmAYogSothothsRemarkChaosMagickReceiving a pm:Receiving ;
    rdfs:label "Yog-Sothoth’s remark on chaos magick"@en, "Aussage Yog-Sothoths"@de ;
    skos:definition "The author attributes to Yog-Sothoth the verdict that chaos magick is merely a nice label for organised non-conformity."@en ;
    pm:receivedBy "Jan Fries" ;
    pm:claimedSpeaker "Yog-Sothoth" ;
    pm:receptionCircumstance "Not a reported trance or session: in an aside on fashions in magick Fries says that Yog-Sothoth assures him of this verdict, in an ironic tone; no circumstance of the hearing, no questioner and no record are given." ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
