pmp:ChaosMagicVmALetterGodsDeepSelf a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Letter to the gods or deep self"@en, "Brief an die Götter"@de ;
    skos:definition "Write a letter to one’s gods, totems, spirits or subconscious self (even a plain salutation to the subconscious helps), using runes or another magical script easy to write but hard to read so ego cannot interfere, and add a few sigils to focus particular issues."@en ;
    skos:note "Author recommends it from his own practice."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:firstPersonReport ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
