pmc:ChaosMagicVmABeingHeardDeeperMind a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Being heard by the deeper mind"@en, "Gehör beim tiefen Selbst"@de ;
    skos:definition "The deeper aspects of mind recognize that they are addressed and attend to the call without needing a definition of gods or subconscious."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
