pmp:ChaosMagicVmADevelopingPersonalMagicalAlphabet a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Developing a personal magical alphabet"@en, "Eigenes Alphabet entwickeln"@de ;
    skos:definition "Ask the deep mind for a script suited to both of you, then go letter by letter, imagining or voicing each sound, until simple signs or shapes appear that fit; a complete alphabet may take several rounds."@en ;
    skos:note "Effort said to be well worth it."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
