pmc:ChaosMagicVmADeepMindWorksMagickConsultIt a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "The deep mind works the magick; consult it"@en, "Das tiefe Selbst wirkt"@de ;
    skos:definition "Results improve when one consults the deep mind and requests its aid instead of stressing conscious control; the deep mind knows what works, but the conscious mind fears surrendering control."@en ;
