pmc:ChaosMagicVmAPreferringTraditionalFormulaeAskingDeepSelfCaution a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Preferring traditional formulae to asking the deep self"@en, "Traditionsformeln statt Fragen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Most magicians, the author included, fatally prefer traditional formulae and endless experiments to simply consulting the deep self on what works."@en ;
    skos:note "Self-warning."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmc:ChaosMagicVmADeepMindWorksMagickConsultIt ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
