pmc:ChaosMagicVmAMagickCommunicationSelfSelf a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Magick as communication from Self to Self"@en, "Vom Selbst zum Selbst"@de ;
    skos:definition "Gods, spirits, angels, demons, beast totems, allies and subconscious name aspects of one phenomenon, the conscious self being one more such aspect; abasing oneself before gods while bossing spirits is infantile; speaking to them as to a beloved friend or partner with honesty and joy brings excellent results."@en ;
    skos:note "Disagreement with traditional ceremonial manners."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
