    rdfs:label "Attending to the deep mind's feedback"@en, "Achten auf die Rückmeldung des tiefen Geistes"@de ;
    skos:definition "Staying open to and noticing the deep mind's answers, given as images, sounds, words or feelings, while one speaks to it about a sigil."@en ;
    skos:note "Added by the integrator from the reading of the whole text; no extraction record carries it."@en ;
