pmp:ChaosMagicVmAAlternatingIntrovertedExtrovertedMethods a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Alternating introverted and extroverted methods"@en, "Innere Stille und Ekstase abwechseln"@de ;
    skos:definition "In ritual workings alternate silent concentration and vacuity with ecstatic chanting, music and dance; this is less straining; hours of work on one sigil are unnecessary because the deep mind may learn very fast."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
