pmp:ChaosMagicVmASigilFocusedOrgasm a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Sigil focused at orgasm"@en, "Sigille im Orgasmus"@de ;
    skos:definition "Concentrate strongly on a sigil or will-image in the mind’s eye during orgasm, while keeping up sexual enthusiasm."@en ;
    skos:note "Said to bind the seed to strong instincts like the urge to unite and to reproduce; many orders reserve it for high degrees."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
