    rdfs:label "Concentration and visualization training before sex sigil work"@en, "Konzentration vor Sexualmagie"@de ;
    skos:definition "Probably solid prior training in concentrating and visualizing is needed to hold the shape during sex."@en ;
    skos:note "The source hedges (you will probably need), so the necessity is entered as prescribed order; the stated risk is that any other idea entering awareness attaches to the sigil."@en ;
