pmc:ChaosMagicVmATrainedConcentrationVisualization a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Trained concentration and visualization"@en, "Geübte Konzentration und Visualisierung"@de ;
    skos:definition "The ability to hold an abstract shape steadily in the mind's eye against intruding ideas, which the author expects sexual sigil work to need."@en ;
