pmp:ChaosMagicVmAReleasingCharacterArmour a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Releasing character armour"@en, "Charakterpanzer lösen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Change sexual attitudes with trance therapy and similar methods, and release the body’s chronic muscular armour with Hatha Yoga, Pranayama, Chinese Qigong and frequent dancing stressing hip movement."@en ;
    skos:note "Theory referred to Wilhelm Reich, The Function of the Orgasm; intellectual tolerance alone said not to dissolve the armour."@en ;
