pmc:ChaosMagicVmASexMagickWithoutLovePathologicalCaution a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Sex magick without love is pathological"@en, "Sexualmagie ohne Liebe"@de ;
    skos:definition "Some esoteric orders advise feeling neither emotion nor love in sex magick; this may keep the image clear but empties the act of meaning; the author calls sex magick pathological unless performed lovingly and as sharing between equals."@en ;
    skos:note "Disagreement with unnamed esoteric orders."@en ;
