pmc:ChaosMagicVmAIntellectualEntryMagickDeniesBodyCaution a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Intellectual entry into magick denies the body"@en, "Körperverleugnung"@de ;
    skos:definition "Entering magick through books and discussion carries a dangerous tendency to deny the body and neglect dance and outdoor activity, which is why sex magick feels like a revelation; wild shamanic trance obsession gives similar energy without spoiling lovemaking."@en ;
