    rdfs:label "Cat’s cradle in trance"@en, "Fadenspiel in Trance"@de ;
    skos:definition "Play cat’s cradle with a longish string in a gentle trance, producing chance sigils without needing to know their meaning, while reflecting on a problem; with a friend or partner make irregular abstract figures together and sort them out jointly."@en ;
    skos:note "Offered as a field for experiment; readers invited to report new methods."@en ;
