pmc:ChaosMagicVmAVisualizationNaturalSkillNeedingPractice a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Visualization: natural skill needing practice"@en, "Visualisierung als natürliche Fähigkeit"@de ;
    skos:definition "Visualization is innate yet requires some training; the needed equipment is the senses, enthusiasm as energy, patience and a friendly subconscious."@en ;
