pmc:ChaosMagicVmAAgainstStartingSimpleImagesDispute a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Against starting with simple images"@en, "Gegen einfache Anfangsbilder"@de ;
    skos:definition "The old masters prescribed points, lines, geometric figures and colour fields for novices; the author has heard mostly curses from those who began so, since such images are too simple and abstract, bore the mind within seconds and drift away."@en ;
    skos:note "Explicit disagreement with the traditional magical training method; only Fries's side is read here, so it is entered as a concept and not as pm:Disputing."@en ;
