pmc:ChaosMagicVmADeepMindFreudsMonsterDispute a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Deep mind is not Freud’s monster"@en, "Gegen Freuds Unbewusstes"@de ;
    skos:definition "The subconscious is called the deep mind to stress that the sentience accompanying us is no dreadful creature of Sigmund Freud and his followers."@en ;
    skos:note "Explicit disagreement with Sigmund Freud; only Fries's side is read here, so it is entered as a concept and not as pm:Disputing."@en ;
