    rdfs:label "Deep mind wants to develop latent powers"@en, "Tiefes Selbst fördert Anlagen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Since the deep mind has led the reader to this book, it can be assumed to have a genuine interest in developing latent powers and talents; readers can develop new skills from the experiences offered."@en ;
