    rdfs:label "Befriending the inner voice"@en, "Innere Stimme freundlich machen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Notice whether the inner voice nags, complains or criticizes; tell it how you would like to hear it and let it become a voice that is a pleasure to listen to."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
