pmc:ChaosMagicVmANamingPerceptionIntensifiesIt a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Naming a perception intensifies it"@en, "Benennen verstärkt"@de ;
    skos:definition "Putting perceptions into words intensifies them; most people do this unconsciously all the time."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 5 Visualization, p. 61; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmp:ChaosMagicVmAElicitingStateAskingDetailedAccounts a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Eliciting state by asking for detailed accounts"@en, "Zustände durch Erzählen hervorrufen"@de ;
    skos:definition "As a demonstration, ask someone for an ever more detailed account of being ill and watch them re-enter and amplify the pain; conversely ask for a vivid account of feeling happy, healthy, powerful or inspired and watch for shifts of posture, breath, muscle tone, skin colour, rhythm and voice."@en ;
    skos:note "Presented as an experiment."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 5 Visualization, p. 61; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmADetailedQuestioningYieldsStateEvocationYield a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Detailed questioning yields state evocation"@en, "Nachfragen ergibt Zustandsauslösung"@de ;
    skos:definition "Asking persistently for details of past experience brings the other person into that state."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChaosMagicVmAElicitingStateAskingDetailedAccounts ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:ChaosMagicVmAEvokingStatesOthersThroughRecollection ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 5 Visualization, p. 61; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmAEvokingStatesOthersThroughRecollection a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Evoking states in others through recollection"@en, "Zustände bei anderen auslösen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Detailed questioning about a past state makes a person relive and amplify it, painful or joyful."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 5 Visualization, p. 61; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmAEthicsElicitingPainfulMemoriesCaution a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Ethics of eliciting painful memories"@en, "Ethik des Nachfragens"@de ;
    skos:definition "Asking someone to recount something awful in detail makes them relive it; the author questions the ethics and notes how often this is done to loved ones out of supposed compassion."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmp:ChaosMagicVmAElicitingStateAskingDetailedAccounts ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
