pmp:ChaosMagicVmAExerciseTwoPerceivingTree a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Exercise two: perceiving a tree"@en, "Übung zwei: einen Baum wahrnehmen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Find a good tree or plant, walk around it and see, listen, feel, taste and smell it; put as much of the perception into words as possible, taking plenty of time and continuing to speak."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 5 Visualization, p. 61; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmAExpandedPerceptionLivingBeing a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Expanded perception of a living being"@en, "Erweiterte Wahrnehmung"@de ;
    skos:definition "Discovering how much detail of a complex living form one can perceive when one chooses."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 5 Visualization, p. 61; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmAExerciseTwoYieldsExpandedPerceptionYield a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Exercise two yields expanded perception"@en, "Übung zwei erweitert Wahrnehmung"@de ;
    skos:definition "The tree exercise reveals and widens one’s perceptual range."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChaosMagicVmAExerciseTwoPerceivingTree ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:ChaosMagicVmAExpandedPerceptionLivingBeing ;
