pmc:ChaosMagicVmBMatchingFiercenessBeforeMartialGodRespondsPrerequisite a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Matching fierceness before a martial god responds"@en, "Passende Wildheit, bevor ein Kriegsgott antwortet"@de ;
    skos:definition "The mage must first be aggressive enough to be real to Mars; war gods do not answer those who kneel, bow, plead, apologise or abase themselves."@en ;
    pm:priorStep pmc:ChaosMagicVmBCongruenceWithInvokedGod ;
    pm:dependentStep pmc:ChaosMagicVmBHealthierDevelopedAggression ;
    pm:prerequisiteStrength pm:statedNecessity ;
    pm:consequenceOfSkipping "Martial deities give no response to a self-abasing mage." ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 6 Access to Imagination, p. 75; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmBSelfAbasementMakesMartialGodsUnresponsiveFailure a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Self-abasement makes martial gods unresponsive"@en, "Selbsterniedrigung macht Kriegsgötter taub"@de ;
    skos:definition "Kneeling, bowing, pleading, apologising or humbling oneself before a war god produces no response."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a condition of failure: of Invoking a martial god to develop aggression; no deadline is set."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 6 Access to Imagination, p. 75; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmBInvokingMartialGodYieldsHealthierDevelopedAggression a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Invoking a martial god to develop aggression yields Healthier, developed aggression"@en, "Anrufung eines Kriegsgottes zur Entwicklung der Aggression ergibt Entwickelte, gesündere Aggression"@de ;
    skos:definition "The practice “Invoking a martial god to develop aggression” is stated to produce “Healthier, developed aggression”."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChaosMagicVmBInvokingMartialGodToDevelopAggression ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:ChaosMagicVmBHealthierDevelopedAggression ;
