pmc:ChaosMagicVmBBuildingAndAnimatingYieldsIdentityChangedAnd a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Building and animating a god-form yields Identity changed and healed from within by an indwelling god"@en, "Aufbau und Belebung einer Gottesform ergibt Von innen durch einwohnenden Gott verwandelte und geheilte Identität"@de ;
    skos:definition "The practice “Building and animating a god-form” is stated to produce “Identity changed and healed from within by an indwelling god”."@en ;
