pmc:ChaosMagicVmBIdentityChangedAndHealedFromWithin a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Identity changed and healed from within by an indwelling god"@en, "Von innen durch einwohnenden Gott verwandelte und geheilte Identität"@de ;
    skos:definition "The invoked divine sentience dwells in the practitioner for the working and alters and heals identity from the inside."@en ;
