    rdfs:label "Associating a pleasant memory yields Full access to the joy of good memories"@en, "Assoziieren einer angenehmen Erinnerung ergibt Voller Zugang zur Freude guter Erinnerungen"@de ;
    skos:definition "The practice “Associating a pleasant memory” is stated to produce “Full access to the joy of good memories”."@en ;
