pmc:ChaosMagicVmBFullAccessToJoyOfGood a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Full access to the joy of good memories"@en, "Voller Zugang zur Freude guter Erinnerungen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Full association with a pleasant memory restores its joy, lust and passion, so that recalling it is nearly as pleasant as the original event."@en ;
