    rdfs:label "Dissociating upsetting events as they happen"@en, "Belastende Ereignisse schon im Geschehen dissoziieren"@de ;
    skos:definition "When something upsetting occurs, dissociate from the outset: step beside yourself and laugh at the situation; when somebody behaves nastily, pretend to be someone else (a visiting ethnologist, mad genius, evil fiend or court jester) or picture the aggressor in a clown suit, during the event itself."@en ;
