pmp:ChaosMagicVmBImaginingMemoryMomentWillBecome a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Imagining the memory a moment will become"@en, "Vorstellen, welche Erinnerung ein Moment ergibt"@de ;
    skos:definition "In the present, ask what kind of memory this moment will produce, whether it is worth living and remembering, and imagine looking back on it ten years from now."@en ;
