pmc:ChaosMagicVmBHowLoversFallIntoRapture a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "How lovers fall into rapture"@en, "Wie Verliebte in Verzückung geraten"@de ;
    skos:definition "Lovers daydream all day of being with the beloved, often seeing the scene dissociated and then stepping into it associated to get the good feelings; the happiness released drives ever more and better dreaming until the world around fades."@en ;
