pmp:ChaosMagicVmBMakingVisionLargeVividCloseAnd a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Making a vision large, vivid, close and entering it"@en, "Eine Vision groß, lebhaft, nah machen und hineingehen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Make the desired vision large, vivid, detailed, colourful and near; build it as an attractive daydream and then step into it to obtain the good feelings."@en ;
