pmc:ChaosMagicVmBUnhappyLoveAsUnenteredDaydream a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Unhappy love as unentered daydream"@en, "Unglückliche Liebe als nicht betretener Tagtraum"@de ;
    skos:definition "The unhappily enamoured may dream the same fulfilment but not dare to associate with it, so the pleasure stays unfelt and sadness results."@en ;
