pmc:ChaosMagicVmBBeingXProcedureReceivedInDreamReceiving a pm:Receiving ;
    rdfs:label "Being-x procedure received in a dream"@en, "Im Traum empfangenes Verfahren des x-Werdens"@de ;
    skos:definition "Fries states that the concrete version of the being-x method that follows came to him in a dream."@en ;
    pm:receivedBy "Jan Fries" ;
    pm:claimedSpeaker "No being is named: the version came to Fries in a dream of his own, which the book treats as the work of the deep mind" ;
    pm:receptionCircumstance "While dreaming; Fries prints the result as a nine-step version of the method for becoming x, for readers who find the short formula too abstract." ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:firstPersonReport ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
