pmc:ChaosMagicVmBStrongChangeOfAwarenessOnLeapingSign a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Strong change of awareness on leaping in"@en, "Starke Bewusstseinsänderung beim Hineinspringen"@de ;
    skos:definition "On leaping into or embracing the image one should feel a marked shift of awareness."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a sign of success: of Mutational leap from point A to point B; announced to the one practising and judged by the operator."@en ;
