pmc:ChaosMagicVmBReportedEffectsOfEnvironmentalColours a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Reported effects of environmental colours"@en, "Berichtete Wirkungen von Umgebungsfarben"@de ;
    skos:definition "Many theories link colours with consciousness states: Gypsies are said to paint their sleeping corners dark purple for more restful sleep; theatre dressing rooms are often light green to calm actors’ nerves."@en ;
    skos:note "Strength in the source: is said to; supposedly."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
