    rdfs:label "Access to the fighting mood when skills are needed"@en, "Zugang zur Kampfstimmung, wenn Fähigkeiten gebraucht werden"@de ;
    skos:definition "The red space embodies the mood of the exercise, the state one may need when the skills are really required."@en ;
