pmc:ChaosMagicVmBEasyColourImaginationForImmersionVariantPrerequisite a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Easy colour imagination for the immersion variant"@en, "Leichtes Farbvorstellen für die Eintauchvariante"@de ;
    skos:definition "The first experiment is meant for people who already imagine colours readily; others may find the doorway variant easier."@en ;
    skos:note "No consequence of skipping is stated."@en ;
