    rdfs:label "Colour immersion in light trance yields Knowing what colours mean to oneself"@en, "Farbeintauchen in leichter Trance ergibt Wissen, was Farben einem selbst bedeuten"@de ;
    skos:definition "The practice “Colour immersion in light trance” is stated to produce “Knowing what colours mean to oneself”."@en ;
