pmc:ChaosMagicVmBCloseCurtainsOnWayBackCautela a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Close the curtains on the way back"@en, "Beim Rückweg die Vorhänge schließen"@de ;
    skos:definition "On returning from the colour world, take care to shut each curtain behind you."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmp:ChaosMagicVmBColourCurtainDoorwayJourney ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 6 Access to Imagination, p. 89; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmp:ChaosMagicVmBRecolouringMemories a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Recolouring memories"@en, "Erinnerungen umfärben"@de ;
    skos:definition "In light trance with eyes closed, choose a fresh recent memory, recall it associated, pick a colour and run through it in that colour (coloured lenses, coloured lights, or coloured air); let the colour dissolve, open and shut the eyes and repeat with another; try several kinds of memory and take notes; with an unhappy memory find colours that make it absurd, neutral or better; with an enjoyed magical working find colours that heighten its radiance; picture yourself in auras of different colours and associate with the image."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 6 Access to Imagination, p. 90; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmBMemoryMoodShiftsWithColourSign a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Memory mood shifts with colour"@en, "Stimmung der Erinnerung ändert sich mit der Farbe"@de ;
    skos:definition "Announced: the mood of the memory will change; some colours suit some memories while others make the scene feel unreal."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a sign of success: of Recolouring memories; announced to the one practising and judged by the operator."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 6 Access to Imagination, p. 90; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

