    rdfs:label "Dissociating emotional impact through colour"@en, "Emotionale Wucht durch Farbe dissoziieren"@de ;
    skos:definition "Certain colours make an unhappy memory seem absurd and let one detach from its emotional force, or feel indifferent or better."@en ;
