pmc:ChaosMagicVmBAnyRitualVoiceWearsOffIfFailure a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Any ritual voice wears off if overused"@en, "Jede Ritualstimme nutzt sich bei Überdehnung ab"@de ;
    skos:definition "However good, a single ritual voice used for too long loses its effect and attention wanders."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a condition of failure: of Golden Dawn vibration of words; no deadline is set."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
