pmc:ChaosMagicVmBMonotonousVoiceOnOneselfInducesSleepCautela a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Monotonous voice on oneself induces sleep"@en, "Monotone Stimme bei sich selbst schläfert ein"@de ;
    skos:definition "A slow, deep, monotonous voice induces exactly such trances; used on oneself it may send one to sleep."@en ;
    skos:note "The caution is about the monotonous trance voice, which the varying voice of the practice node replaces."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmp:ChaosMagicVmBVaryingHypnoticVoicePausesWhisperWildness ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
