pmp:ChaosMagicVmBVaryingHypnoticVoicePausesWhisperWildness a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Varying hypnotic voice: pauses, whisper, wildness"@en, "Hypnotische Stimme variieren: Pausen, Flüstern, Wildheit"@de ;
    skos:definition "Fit the voice to the intended trance: use pauses with art (as Milton Erickson did), whisper suggestions so the listener attends more closely, or use a wild, exciting voice where a trance calls for it."@en ;
    skos:note "Fries ascribes this to Milton Erickson; the named source is reachable in its own right and is not read through him, so the node is entered as his ascription and not as a mediated reading."@en ;
