pmc:ChaosMagicVmBTransformationFromWithinByDrinkingCharged a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Transformation from within by drinking the charged fluid"@en, "Verwandlung von innen durch Trinken der geladenen Flüssigkeit"@de ;
    skos:definition "Drinking the blended blessings transforms the practitioner from inside."@en ;
