pmp:ChaosMagicVmBElementalVoices a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Elemental voices"@en, "Elementstimmen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Give each element its own voice: earth deep, sonorous, firm and slow; water swaying, surging, pulsing and rhythmic, stressing sibilants; fire wild and fierce, erupting, calming, roaring again (rant and rave); air calmer, breathing, sighing, howling, whistling, whispering, sometimes only joyous gusts of breath; spirit in a personal voice."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 7 Imagination and Prayer, p. 98; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmBOneVoiceForAllElementsFailure a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "One voice for all elements"@en, "Eine Stimme für alle Elemente"@de ;
    skos:definition "Invoking every element in the same voice sounds dull, especially in a long rite, and reaches only the brain regions that read abstract word symbols."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a condition of failure: of Invoking the elements in three speech stages; no deadline is set."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 7 Imagination and Prayer, p. 100; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmBInvocationWorksOnlyThroughExperiencedIdentityPrerequisite a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Invocation works only through experienced identity"@en, "Anrufung wirkt nur durch erlebte Identität"@de ;
    skos:definition "An invocation is effective only when it makes one experience what one talks about; that identity, not the wording, validates the rite."@en ;
    pm:priorStep pmc:ChaosMagicVmBIdentityWithInvokedForce ;
    pm:dependentStep pmc:ChaosMagicVmBInvocation ;
    pm:prerequisiteStrength pm:statedNecessity ;
    pm:consequenceOfSkipping "Without that experience the invocation is not effective." ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 7 Imagination and Prayer, p. 100; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmBIdentityWithInvokedForce a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Identity with the invoked force"@en, "Identität mit der angerufenen Kraft"@de ;
    skos:definition "Experiencing what one speaks of so completely that one becomes it, e.g. so fiery that one is consumed by the force."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 7 Imagination and Prayer, p. 100; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmBTwoWeeksOfDailyCupPrayerPrerequisite a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Two weeks of daily cup prayer before group work"@en, "Zwei Wochen tägliches Kelchgebet vor Gruppenarbeit"@de ;
    skos:definition "Beginners should pray once a day for at least two weeks; this readies them for group sessions."@en ;
    skos:note "No consequence of skipping is stated."@en ;
    pm:priorStep pmp:ChaosMagicVmBCupMeditation ;
    pm:dependentStep pmp:ChaosMagicVmBGroupCupWorkingWithSoundAmplification ;
