pmp:ChaosMagicVmBGroupCupWorkingWithSoundAmplification a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Group cup working with sound amplification"@en, "Gruppen-Kelcharbeit mit Klangverstärkung"@de ;
    skos:definition "The two cups pass to each participant, who invokes whatever they will as it comes; the others amplify with fitting sounds: a slow deep drum for earth, flutes and horns for air, click sticks for the crackle of fire, water sloshed in a bowl for water."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 7 Imagination and Prayer, p. 100; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmp:ChaosMagicVmBGroupCupMeditationInChaosLanguage a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Group cup meditation in chaos language"@en, "Gruppen-Kelchmeditation in Chaossprache"@de ;
    skos:definition "For those practised in the elements prayer: meet like-minded friends, sit with the cups and run the usual programme only in chaos language, with no reasonable words or names, just noises, sounds, song, chant and chaos words; earth as deep droning on m, n, o, u; water as surf, gull cries, falling drops, hissing and gurgling; fire as cracking wood, small explosions, screaming and roaring; air as howling, whistling, sighing wind and long sung vowels."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 7 Imagination and Prayer, p. 100; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmBPractiseElementsPrayerBeforeChaosLanguagePrerequisite a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Practise the elements prayer before the chaos-language group form"@en, "Elementgebet üben vor der Gruppenform in Chaossprache"@de ;
    skos:definition "The chaos-language group version is meant for those who have done the elements prayer for some time."@en ;
    skos:note "No consequence of skipping is stated."@en ;
    pm:priorStep pmp:ChaosMagicVmBInvokingElementsInThreeSpeechStages ;
    pm:dependentStep pmp:ChaosMagicVmBGroupCupMeditationInChaosLanguage ;
