pmc:ChaosMagicVmBFabricOfSoundComingAliveSign a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "A fabric of sound coming alive"@en, "Ein lebendig werdendes Klanggewebe"@de ;
    skos:definition "When several people do this together, their sounds weave a fabric that may come vividly alive."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a sign of success: of Group cup meditation in chaos language; announced to the one practising and judged by the operator."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
