pmc:ChaosMagicVmBChaosSoundWorkingMayHaveSideCautela a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Chaos-sound working may have side effects"@en, "Chaosklang-Arbeit kann Nebenwirkungen haben"@de ;
    skos:definition "Fries notes this practice may bring side effects (in context: loss of dignified composure, wild behaviour)."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmp:ChaosMagicVmBGroupCupMeditationInChaosLanguage ;
