pmc:ChaosMagicVmBForgettingControlAndBecomingWhatYouSign a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Forgetting control and becoming what you address"@en, "Kontrolle vergessen und zu dem werden, was man anspricht"@de ;
    skos:definition "One is doing well when control and dignity are forgotten and one turns into what one is speaking with."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a sign of success: of Cup meditation (two-cup prayer); announced to the one practising and judged by the operator."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
