pmc:ChaosMagicVmBSwayingSweatingRantingAsSignsOfSign a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Swaying, sweating, ranting as signs of doing fine"@en, "Schwanken, Schwitzen, Toben als Zeichen des Gelingens"@de ;
    skos:definition "Swaying, shaking, sweating, screaming, mad impulses or ranting in chaos language mean one is doing fine."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a sign of success: of Cup meditation (two-cup prayer); announced to the one practising and judged by the operator."@en ;
