pmc:ChaosMagicVmBDeepMagickFollowsDeepMindsOwn a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Deep magick follows the deep mind’s own laws"@en, "Tiefe Magie folgt den eigenen Gesetzen des Tiefengeists"@de ;
    skos:definition "Much of the deeper magick is done by deep-mind parts whose laws look insane to consciousness; releasing and integrating them shows that control is unnecessary and true dignity is not stiffness."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
