    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 8 Mandala Building, p. 109; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmBCarryingPromiseOfFreshLifeThrough a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Carrying the promise of fresh life through winter"@en, "Das Versprechen neuen Lebens durch den Winter tragen"@de ;
    skos:definition "The hoop, symbol of the year’s cycle, keeps the joy and promise of new life present at home through the dark, cold season."@en ;
