pmp:ChaosMagicVmBSpeakingWithPlantsWhileGathering a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Speaking with plants while gathering"@en, "Beim Sammeln mit Pflanzen sprechen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Talk with the plants aloud and clearly even if it feels silly; tell them what they are being gathered for, describe their form, symbolism and meaning and ask them to come along; ask some for permission and heed how they show what and how much may be taken."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 8 Mandala Building, p. 109; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmBPlantsUnderstandVoiceAndMoodNot a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Plants understand voice and mood, not words"@en, "Pflanzen verstehen Stimme und Stimmung, nicht Worte"@de ;
    skos:definition "Plants may not grasp words but respond to modulation and mood; readers of Castaneda will know the practice. The word silly is traced to Old High German saelig, blessed."@en ;
    skos:note "Fries ascribes this to Carlos Castaneda (reference); the named source is reachable in its own right and is not read through him, so the node is entered as his ascription and not as a mediated reading."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 8 Mandala Building, p. 110; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmBAskCertainPlantsForPermissionCautela a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Ask certain plants for permission"@en, "Bestimmte Pflanzen um Erlaubnis bitten"@de ;
    skos:definition "Certain plants should be asked before they are gathered."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmp:ChaosMagicVmBSpeakingWithPlantsWhileGathering ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
