pmc:ChaosMagicVmBLearningFromPlantsWhatMayBe a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Learning from plants what may be taken"@en, "Von Pflanzen erfahren, was genommen werden darf"@de ;
    skos:definition "Plants find a way to let the gatherer know what and how much may be taken."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
