pmc:ChaosMagicVmBSpeakingWithPlantsYieldsLearningFromPlants a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Speaking with plants while gathering yields Learning from plants what may be taken"@en, "Beim Sammeln mit Pflanzen sprechen ergibt Von Pflanzen erfahren, was genommen werden darf"@de ;
    skos:definition "The practice “Speaking with plants while gathering” is stated to produce “Learning from plants what may be taken”."@en ;
