pmc:ChaosMagicVmBTranceStatesThroughExtendedPrayer a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Trance states through extended prayer"@en, "Trancezustände durch ausgedehntes Gebet"@de ;
    skos:definition "Praying over the materials may lead to entertaining trance states, provided one really starts speaking and lets oneself be carried away."@en ;
