pmp:ChaosMagicVmBBlessingWholeMandala a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Blessing the whole mandala"@en, "Segnen des ganzen Mandalas"@de ;
    skos:definition "Consecrate the finished mandala as a whole with the cup prayer: invoke into the fluid whatever seems fit, soak mandala and room with it, and drink the remainder."@en ;
    skos:note "Added by the integrator from the reading of the whole text; no extraction record carries it."@en, "Stage node of the seven-stage series of the mandala offering."@en ;
