pmc:ChaosMagicVmBCupPrayerUsedToConsecratePlatePrerequisite a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Cup prayer used to consecrate the plate mandala"@en, "Kelchgebet zur Weihe des Tellermandalas"@de ;
    skos:definition "Consecrating the finished mandala uses the prayer method of the previous chapter."@en ;
    skos:note "No consequence of skipping is stated."@en ;
