pmp:ChaosMagicVmBBurningMandala a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Burning the mandala"@en, "Verbrennen des Mandalas"@de ;
    skos:definition "After the pause and further prayer, drench the mandala in pure alcohol and burn it, releasing the gathered forces in one act; bury the leftovers and ashes the following day."@en ;
    skos:note "Added by the integrator from the reading of the whole text; no extraction record carries it."@en, "Stage node of the seven-stage series of the mandala offering."@en ;
