pmc:ChaosMagicVmBMandalaOfferingWorksLikeSigil a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Mandala offering works like a sigil"@en, "Mandalaopfer wirkt wie eine Sigille"@de ;
    skos:definition "The offering passes through collecting and gathering, alignment, dedication, blessing, burning and forgetting, sending the deep mind a powerful message; unlike sigil work it adds a walk in nature and much handling and praying, which makes it more practical."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 8 Mandala Building, p. 112; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmp:ChaosMagicVmBForgettingOffering a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Forgetting the offering"@en, "Vergessen der Gabe"@de ;
    skos:definition "The last stage, as with a sigil: once the offering is burned and buried, it is let go from mind so that its message can work in the deep mind."@en ;
    skos:note "Added by the integrator from the reading of the whole text; no extraction record carries it."@en, "Stage node of the seven-stage series of the mandala offering."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 8 Mandala Building, p. 112; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmBSevenStagesOfMandalaOfferingStages a pm:Sequencing ;
    rdfs:label "Seven stages of the mandala offering"@en, "Sieben Stufen des Mandalaopfers"@de ;
    skos:definition "Collect, gather, align, dedicate, bless, burn, forget."@en ;
    skos:note "The series of the steps of pmp:ChaosMagicVmBBrassPlateMandalaOffering."@en ;
    rdf:_1 pmp:ChaosMagicVmBCollectingMaterialInNature ;
    rdf:_2 pmp:ChaosMagicVmBGatheringMaterialAtHome ;
    rdf:_3 pmp:ChaosMagicVmBAligningItemsOnPlate ;
    rdf:_4 pmp:ChaosMagicVmBDedicatingEachItemByPrayer ;
    rdf:_5 pmp:ChaosMagicVmBBlessingWholeMandala ;
    rdf:_6 pmp:ChaosMagicVmBBurningMandala ;
    rdf:_7 pmp:ChaosMagicVmBForgettingOffering ;
    pm:seriesStatement "Fries lists seven acts of the mandala offering in this order and likens them to the course of a sigil: the material is collected, gathered, aligned, dedicated and blessed into one ordered message, which is then burned and forgotten so that the deep mind can act on it." ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 8 Mandala Building, p. 112; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmBReleaseOfPressureAndTensionThrough a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Release of pressure and tension through prayer"@en, "Lösen von Druck und Spannung durch Gebet"@de ;
    skos:definition "Prayer relieves pressure and tension (exhausting oneself in prayer can help) and gathers ideas, visions and symbols into one ordered form."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 8 Mandala Building, p. 112; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmBBrassPlateMandalaYieldsReleaseOfPressure a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Brass-plate mandala offering yields Release of pressure and tension through prayer"@en, "Messingteller-Mandalaopfer ergibt Lösen von Druck und Spannung durch Gebet"@de ;
    skos:definition "The practice “Brass-plate mandala offering” is stated to produce “Release of pressure and tension through prayer”."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChaosMagicVmBBrassPlateMandalaOffering ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:ChaosMagicVmBReleaseOfPressureAndTensionThrough ;
