pmc:ChaosMagicVmCSacrificeDemandingRiverSwampMountainSpiritsNaming a pm:Naming ;
    rdfs:label "Sacrifice-demanding river, swamp and mountain spirits"@en, "Opferfordernde Fluss-, Sumpf- und Berggeister"@de ;
    skos:definition "Folk belief held many river, swamp and mountain spirits dangerous, demanding a yearly sacrifice of human or animal; if neglected they raged in storms, floods or avalanches."@en ;
