pmc:ChaosMagicVmCSeeingFiguresRandomForms a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Seeing figures in random forms"@en, "Gestalten in Zufallsformen sehen"@de ;
    skos:definition "The faculty of seeing visions, faces, landscapes and dream figures in sufficiently complex random structures (walls, clouds, rocks, smoke)."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 9 Spirits of Nature, p. 133; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmp:ChaosMagicVmCGazingWithoutNaming a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Gazing without naming"@en, "Schauen ohne Benennen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Choose a very complex structure (great clouds, coarse rocks), relax or enter light trance, watch the surface and stare without naming details; simply see form as if not knowing what it is, for a long time."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 9 Spirits of Nature, p. 133; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmCGazingWithoutNamingYieldsSeeingFiguresRandom a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Gazing without naming yields seeing figures in random forms"@en, "Schauen ohne Benennen führt zu: Gestalten in Zufallsformen sehen"@de ;
    skos:definition "In Fries's account the practice named gazing without naming leads to the capacity named seeing figures in random forms."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChaosMagicVmCGazingWithoutNaming ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:ChaosMagicVmCSeeingFiguresRandomForms ;
