pmc:ChaosMagicVmCSeeingWithoutSpeech a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Seeing without speech (inner silence)"@en, "Sehen ohne Sprache (innere Stille)"@de ;
    skos:definition "Perceiving with the inner monologue stopped, which frees the mind to imagine new forms into given material."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 9 Spirits of Nature, p. 133; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmp:ChaosMagicVmCMethodsHaltInnerMonologue a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Methods to halt the inner monologue"@en, "Wege, den inneren Monolog zu stillen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Let the inner voice fade or be forgotten, be too busy seeing to attend to words, ask the voice to change its program, speak chaos language to oneself, let it make music or abstract sound patterns, or attend to silence itself."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 9 Spirits of Nature, p. 133; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmCMethodsHaltInnerYieldsSeeingWithoutSpeech a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Methods to halt the inner monologue yields seeing without speech"@en, "Wege, den inneren Monolog zu stillen führt zu: Sehen ohne Sprache"@de ;
    skos:definition "In Fries's account the practice named methods to halt the inner monologue leads to the capacity named seeing without speech."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChaosMagicVmCMethodsHaltInnerMonologue ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:ChaosMagicVmCSeeingWithoutSpeech ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
