pmc:ChaosMagicVmCHemisphericAccountVision a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Hemispheric account of vision"@en, "Hemisphärische Erklärung des Sehens"@de ;
    skos:definition "When one brain hemisphere stops naming the thing an ordinary rock, the other gets a chance to sense it as unique and new."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 9 Spirits of Nature, p. 134; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmCInsightFromRandomShapes a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Insight from random shapes"@en, "Einsicht aus Zufallsformen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Gaining wisdom or insight (e.g. runes) from figures the mind finds in random structures."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 9 Spirits of Nature, p. 134; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmp:ChaosMagicVmCGazingIntoSmokeFireInsight a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Gazing into smoke or fire for insight"@en, "Schauen in Rauch oder Feuer"@de ;
    skos:definition "Ancient seers and prophets gazed into the smoke of incense or into a burning bush to find wisdom in the random shapes."@en ;
    skos:note "Fries reports this of others; the node holds his ascription."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 9 Spirits of Nature, p. 134; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmCGazingIntoSmokeYieldsInsightFromRandom a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Gazing into smoke or fire for insight yields insight from random shapes"@en, "Schauen in Rauch oder Feuer führt zu: Einsicht aus Zufallsformen"@de ;
    skos:definition "In Fries's account the practice named gazing into smoke or fire for insight leads to the capacity named insight from random shapes."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChaosMagicVmCGazingIntoSmokeFireInsight ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:ChaosMagicVmCInsightFromRandomShapes ;
