    rdfs:label "Knowledge of trees, nature and earth from within"@en, "Wissen über Bäume, Natur und Erde von innen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Having become sufficiently tree-like, one learns about trees, nature and the earth what one had not known."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
