pmc:ChaosMagicVmCEinsteinPhotonThoughtExperimentSubjectiveMagick a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Einstein's photon thought-experiment as subjective magick"@en, "Einsteins Photonen-Gedankenexperiment als subjektive Magie"@de ;
    skos:definition "Einstein spent hours imagining being a photon; subjective imagination led to discoveries about space and time, cited as parallel to shape-shifting."@en ;
    skos:note "Fries reports this of others; the node holds his ascription."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
