pmc:ChaosMagicVmCStonesStoreChargedMemories a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Stones store charged memories"@en, "Steine speichern geladene Erinnerungen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Esoteric teachings claim stones, especially quartz-rich ones, gather and keep intense thoughts and emotions for years or centuries; rocks at sacred sites charged by ceremony keep this information on its own wavelength, unnoticed by tourists."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
