    rdfs:label "Tapping memory streams of rocks"@en, "Gedächtnisströme von Felsen abrufen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Those with magical talent may tap memories stored in rocks at sacred sites; with months or years of patient exploration one may find several cults of different ages each left a distinct memory stream in the stone."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
