pmp:ChaosMagicVmCCrystalGazingClosedEyes a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Crystal gazing with closed eyes (Achad)"@en, "Kristallschauen mit geschlossenen Augen (Achad)"@de ;
    skos:definition "When staring into a crystal ball becomes a strain and, as trance deepens, the eyes tire and want to close, let them close and continue looking into the crystal in imagination, forgetting the crystal once visions start."@en ;
    skos:note "Fries reports this from Frater Achad, paper on clairvoyance; the node holds his ascription, and the source he names is not read through him."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
