pmc:ChaosMagicVmCValueVisionsLiesTheirEffect a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Value of visions lies in their effect"@en, "Wert von Visionen liegt in ihrer Wirkung"@de ;
    skos:definition "Subjective minds cannot perceive objective realities; no vision should be insisted on as true however vivid; one need neither believe nor disbelieve; the only quality test is what one makes of it: if it moves, teaches, inspires or transforms, it is genuine enough."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
