    rdfs:label "Armchair elemental work"@en, "Elementarbeit im Wohnzimmer"@de ;
    skos:definition "Modern witches who work only in heated living rooms with abstract symbols never meet the raw force of the elements; city-dwellers know fire from television and earth under asphalt."@en ;
