pmc:ChaosMagicVmCComingTermsFireAspects a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Coming to terms with one's fire aspects"@en, "Mit den eigenen Feueranteilen ins Reine kommen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Meeting fire spirits who know fire as their essence, and thereby integrating the fire aspects of one's own nature."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 9 Spirits of Nature, p. 144; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmp:ChaosMagicVmCCongruentStatesEarthWaterAirSpirits a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Congruent states for earth, water and air spirits"@en, "Kongruente Zustände für Erd-, Wasser- und Luftgeister"@de ;
    skos:definition "Earth spirits: reach them through stillness and deep relaxation. Water spirits: in gentle drowsiness, body swaying softly, speech surging and pulsing like waves. Air spirits: exposure to wind, prayer, singing, dancing, deep breathing, free speech, open sky."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 9 Spirits of Nature, p. 144; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmCCongruentStatesEarthYieldsContactElementalSpirits a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Congruent states for earth, water and air spirits yields contact with elemental spirits / recognising an element's essence"@en, "Kongruente Zustände für Erd-, Wasser- und Luftgeister führt zu: Kontakt mit Elementargeistern / Wesen eines Elements erkennen"@de ;
    skos:definition "In Fries's account the practice named congruent states for earth, water and air spirits leads to the capacity named contact with elemental spirits / recognising an element's essence."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChaosMagicVmCCongruentStatesEarthWaterAirSpirits ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:ChaosMagicVmCContactElementalSpiritsRecognisingElementEssence ;
