    rdfs:label "Reading aggression as a signal yields using emotions as signals"@en, "Aggression als Signal lesen führt zu: Gefühle als Signale nutzen"@de ;
    skos:definition "In Fries's account the practice named reading aggression as a signal leads to the capacity named using emotions as signals."@en ;
