pmp:ChaosMagicVmCWorkingOffAdrenalineOverdose a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Working off an adrenaline overdose"@en, "Adrenalinüberschuss abarbeiten"@de ;
    skos:definition "Deal with the fight-or-flight chemistry by working it off: running, dancing, long walks in the country, singing or screaming wild music, or a vigorous martial art."@en ;
