pmc:ChaosMagicVmCReturnPeacefulnessAfterAggression a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Return to peacefulness after aggression"@en, "Rückkehr zur Friedfertigkeit nach Aggression"@de ;
    skos:definition "Becoming peaceful again by dealing with the neurochemicals that favour fight or flight; martial artists become gentle once their aggressive parts have an outlet."@en ;
