pmc:ChaosMagicVmCRepressingAggressionCaution a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Repressing aggression (white-lighters)"@en, "Verdrängte Aggression (White-Lighter)"@de ;
    skos:definition "Attempting to rise above aggression by denying it often costs the ability to express any emotion; the disease is misapplying or repressing the inheritance, not aggression itself."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmc:ChaosMagicVmCAcceptingAggressivePartsBringsPeace ;
