    rdfs:label "Specialist saints and spirits (pantheistic model)"@en, "Spezialisierte Heilige und Geister"@de ;
    skos:definition "Catholic saints, Tibetan minor Buddhas and ceremonial Taoist spirits are specialists each working specific miracles; one contacts the specialist in charge (e.g. St Christopher for safe journeys, not for card games)."@en ;
