pmc:ChaosMagicVmCOneAndManyHolisticSpecificEffect a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "One and many: holistic vs specific effect"@en, "Eins und viele: ganzheitliche vs. gezielte Wirkung"@de ;
    skos:definition "Both monotheistic (they are one) and pantheistic (they are many) views are needed: for a holistic effect treat the mind as a unity, for a particular effect consult the specialist in charge; each spirit aligned with the whole corresponds to a self-aspect healed and made whole."@en ;
