pmc:ChaosMagicVmCHealingMagickThroughPossessingSpirits a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Healing and magick through possessing spirits"@en, "Heilung und Magie durch besitzende Geister"@de ;
    skos:definition "Disclosing the unknown, achieving the impossible, working magick and healing through possession by guardian spirits (deep-mind parts specialised for these tasks)."@en ;
