pmc:ChaosMagicVmCPurificationRadiantAngelSign a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Purification and radiant angel"@en, "Läuterung und strahlender Engel"@de ;
    skos:definition "By the time the angel appears, the mage is purified enough to meet it; months of discipline and enthusiasm ensure a complete angel shining with power and sentience; the mage creates an angel radiating true will, the angel an adept fit to live it."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a sign of success: in the Abra-Melin operation the angel appears to a mage purified by months of discipline, fully formed and radiant. Fries summarises the system, and the caution that this yoga breeds madness stands beside it."@en, "Bears on pmp:ChaosMagicVmCAbraMelinOperation."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
