pmc:ChaosMagicVmCWesternRemnantsBeastMagick a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Western remnants of beast magick"@en, "Westliche Reste der Tiermagie"@de ;
    skos:definition "In the West sacred guardian animals survive only in distorted form as witches' familiars and the werewolf legend; shape- or consciousness-changing legends exist worldwide."@en ;
