pmc:ChaosMagicVmCChildrenGamesNaturalMagick a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Children's games as natural magick"@en, "Kinderspiele als natürliche Magie"@de ;
    skos:definition "Children's beast games are efficient unconscious magick that programs reality; the role is fully experienced and surprising powers and drives surface."@en ;
