pmc:ChaosMagicVmCDiscoveringDoingTrueWillThroughBeast a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Discovering and doing true will through the beast"@en, "Den wahren Willen durch das Tier finden und tun"@de ;
    skos:definition "After the pact the beast helps discover and do true will, teaches new attitudes and methods, brings new self-aspects and wider choice, revealing there is more to oneself than one's human personality."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VisualMagick ;
    dcterms:source "Fries, Visual Magick: A Practical Guide to Trance, Sigils and Visualization Techniques (Oxford: Mandrake of Oxford, copyright 1992; a later printing with ISBN 978-1-869928-57-5), chapter 10 Waking the Beasts, p. 172; read in the full-text layer of the open scan archive item JanFries-visual-magick-1992" .

pmc:ChaosMagicVmCPactBeastYieldsDiscoveringDoingTrue a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Pact with the beast yields discovering and doing true will through the beast"@en, "Pakt mit dem Tier führt zu: Den wahren Willen durch das Tier finden und tun"@de ;
    skos:definition "In Fries's account the practice named pact with the beast leads to the capacity named discovering and doing true will through the beast."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChaosMagicVmCPactBeast ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:ChaosMagicVmCDiscoveringDoingTrueWillThroughBeast ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
