pmc:ChaosMagicVmCRangeTranceBetweenHumanBeast a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Range of trance between human and beast"@en, "Spektrum der Trance zwischen Mensch und Tier"@de ;
    skos:definition "Not either human or beast: a wide range of often pleasant trance states lies between."@en ;
