pmc:ChaosMagicVmCBeastsWakeOverIntellectual a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Beasts wake the over-intellectual"@en, "Tiere wecken den Verkopften"@de ;
    skos:definition "Beast spirits delight in the body; when Fries becomes over-intellectual they rouse him to go into the woods."@en ;
